    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The Agnietta \u2013 The Holy Healer and the Cursed Dungeon<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138450/extras/dc1b9ee6cb1a69766300820beb3feca4.avif?t=1733469147\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Story Background]</h2>Our heroine is a demure, divine healer who accepts the task of purifying the cursed dungeon. <br>Along the way, she may encounter all sorts of lust-filled demons. <br>Can you help Demyra escape all the traps in the dungeon just waiting for a naive, innocent girl?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138450/extras/40f5e8448e7fd82774781689e3eacc1d.avif?t=1733469147\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Gameplay]</h2>A 2D action RPG with an overhead view.<br>The heroine Demyra learns new skills with each new encounter.<br>Her skills range from attack, defense, or status effects on her body.<br>Battles occur real-time as she explores each new map.<br>Players can fight, avoid, or be &quot;friendly&quot; with monsters, depending on her status.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Multiple body-changing statuses]</h2>The dungeon is full of perverted monsters that chase Demyra's perfect body.<br>Many of them want to attach themselves to her body; like parasites, they cause various status effects.<br>Some dungeon puzzles might require combinations of perverted status effects!<br>Keep track of her full-body sprite to see what she currently is suffering from! <br>There are tons of combinations to experiment with, so feel free to let your imagination soar! \ud83d\ude42<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[High-quality CG artwork and non-gameover gameplay]</h2>All monster encounters have multiple high-quality HD art CGs.<br>Defeated CG scenes do not immediately lead to gameovers; players can continue despite being &quot;parasited.&quot;<br>Demyra's state of mind may change depending on how many negative statuses she carries.<br>All monster attacks play a role, and the story can change whether she is a pious virgin versus how much corruption she has experienced...",
